					"content": "200摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223050302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 223050302,
					"content": "您這還挺謹慎的啊…也行，您看那邊，選一塊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223050303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "石頭"
				},
				{
					"id": 223050303,
					"content": "您可看仔細了，200摩拉呢，好歹也是錢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223050304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "石頭"
				},
				{
					"id": 223050304,
					"content": "看上哪一塊您和我說，我來把璞石給開了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
